              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni mwaja mu ntambara kurwanya abansi banyu, mukabona amafarasi n’imikogote n’ abantu babaruta ubginshi, ntimuze mubatinye; kuk’ Uhoraho Imana yanyu yabakūye mu gihugu ca Egiputa azoba ari kumwe namwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze ni mwashika hafi y’urugamba, umuherezi aze yēgēre abantu, ababarire, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ati Ni mwumve, yemwe Bisirayeli: uyu musi mwēgereye urugamba ngo murwane n’abansi banyu; ntimuranduke imitima, ntimutinye, ntimugire ubgoba, canke ngo mubacikire ivutu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
