              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko muze murandure rwose ayo mahanga, ni bo Baheti, n’ Abamori, n’Abanyakanani, n’Abaferizi, n’Abahiwi, n’Abayebusi, nk’ uk’ Uhoraho Imana yanyu yababariye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.17",
