              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni mwamara igihe kirekire mujiguje igisagara, muriko murarwana na co ngo mukineshe, ntimuze muhitane incabiti ngo muririke ibiti vyaho, kuko muzorya ivyamye kuri vyo. Ntimuze muvyicire: non’ igiti co ku musozi mbega na co kibaye umuntu, vyotuma mugitera nk’ico gisagara? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
