              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mugabo, ibiti muzi ko bitama ibiribga, muze mubiririke, mubice, muvyubakishe ivyo kwuririrako kur’ ico gisagara kiriko kirabarwanya, gushitsa aho muzogitsindira.",
          "type": "text",
